<title>CYPRUS: Cyprus accepts Cargill tender for maize.</title>
<headline>Cyprus accepts Cargill tender for maize.</headline>
<dateline>NICOSIA 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Cyprus Grain Commission on Tuesday accepted the tender of Cargill for 18,000 tonnes of maize at $143.79 per tonne.</p>
<p>The price includes C&amp;F, a statement from the commission said. Shipment is scheduled in March.</p>
</text>
